From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dynamic Devices <engineering@dynamicdevices.co.uk>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] gl: match GBM EGL native window type for Wayland

The Wayland GPU sources include gbm.h before EGL, selecting a void pointer
for EGLNativeWindowType. The core GL translation unit otherwise selects
intptr_t through USE_OZONE, producing a different C++ constructor symbol
for NativeViewGLSurfaceEGL and an undefined reference at the final link.

Include GBM before the EGL surface header so both translation units agree.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [i.MX Wayland GBM product configuration]

---
 ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.cc | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.cc b/ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.cc
index abcd123..abcd124 100644
--- a/ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.cc
+++ b/ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.cc
@@ -5 +5,3 @@
+#include <gbm.h>
+
 #include "ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.h"
